## Measured semantics — out of scope

These properties of `src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.ts` record the measured semantics that hook features specify against. The `onError` boundary remains out of scope; issue #93 defines the aggregate usage delivered after tool rounds.

- The `catch` gates `onError` on `error instanceof Error` ([chatOrchestrator.ts#L150](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.ts#L150)), so a rejection that is not an `Error` — a thrown string or object — bypasses `onError` entirely while still propagating to the caller.
- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits and receives the summed provider-call usage for the entire turn, so tool rounds are included in a deployer's billing or audit total ([validated by: reports the summed usage from every provider call in a turn with two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L44)).
- A turn in which no provider call reports usage delivers `undefined` to `afterModelResponse`, and a turn where some rounds report and others do not delivers the sum of the rounds that did, never `NaN` ([validated by: counts reported rounds while leaving a turn with no reported usage undefined](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L67)).
- The usage sum adds each token field across the rounds that reported usage ([validated by: sums each token field across the rounds that reported usage](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L33)).
- A round that reports no usage adds nothing to the sum, so a later silent round keeps the earlier reported total ([validated by: keeps the rounds that reported when a later round reported nothing](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L40)), and an earlier silent round does too ([validated by: keeps the rounds that reported when an earlier round reported nothing](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L46)).
- A turn in which no provider call reports usage leaves the usage undefined ([validated by: leaves a turn with no reported usage undefined](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L29)).
